 class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"64279ecae5246baf\" href=\"?note=64279ecae5246baf\" title=\"88-df-computable-function\">88-df-computable-function</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}tm\\text{-}equals\\text{-}recursive} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{PartRec}(f)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Comp}(f)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}tm\\text{-}equals\\text{-}recursive} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{PartRec}(f)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Comp}(f)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>部分递归函数与Turing可计算函数完全等价</li>\n<li>原式把“机器七元组类”<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TM}\">\\(\\mathrm{TM}\\)</span>与“部分函数类”直接相等，类型不一致；现改为同一函数上的谓词等价。</li>\n<li>Church-Turing论题的基础</li>\n<li>多种可计算性定义的一致性</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"88-df-partial-recursive","status":"resolved","id":"19695ddba8e7d948","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-partial-recursive]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-computable-function","status":"resolved","id":"64279ecae5246baf","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-computable-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-partial-recursive","status":"resolved","id":"19695ddba8e7d948","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PartRec}(f)$ (partial-recursive predicate, see [[88-df-partial-recursive]])","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-computable-function","status":"resolved","id":"64279ecae5246baf","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\